%29%3B%0A%20%20const%20value%3D%7BsourceCommit%3Arevision%2CpreviousSourceCommit%3Apredecessor%2C%0A%20%20%20%20review%3A%27The%20actual%20checked-program%20validator%20now%20admits%20only%20absent%20or%20explicit%20Boolean%20utf16Strings%20metadata.%20Complete%20semantic%20rechecking%20retains%20that%20exact%20present%20flag%20before%20the%20unchanged%20whole-IR%20comparison.%20Every%20other%20provider%20byte%20remains%20unchanged.%20Both%20complete%20changed%20modules%20and%20all%20five%20independently%20certified%20current%20and%20preceding%20sources%20are%20retained%3B%20two%20exact%20whole-module%20inverse%20actions%20restore%20the%20original%20source%20profile.%20This%20is%20source%20conservation%20and%20an%20admitted-domain%20extension%2C%20not%20proof%20that%20changed%20operations%20have%20identical%20meaning%20or%20that%20native%20execution%20passed.%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20providers%2Cinverse%2Ccertificates%7D%3B%0A%20%20const%20output%3Dnew%20URL%28file%2Croot%29%3Bif%28check%29checkProjectData%28output%2Cvalue%29%3Belse%20writeProjectData%28output%2Cvalue%29%3B%0A%20%20const%20helper%3Dnew%20URL%28%27.%2Foverlay-provider-revision.mjs%27%2Cimport.meta.url%29%2Csource%3DreadFileSync%28helper%2C%27utf8%27%29%3B%0A%20%20const%20expected%3Dsource.replace%28%2Fconst%20packetSha256%3D%27%28%3F%3APENDING%7C%5Ba-f0-9%5D%7B64%7D%29%27%3B%2Fu%2C%22const%20packetSha256%3D%27%22%2Bhash%28readFileSync%28output%29%29%2B%22%27%3B%22%29%3B%0A%20%20if%28check%29assert.equal%28source%2Cexpected%29%3Belse%20writeFileSync%28helper%2Cexpected%29%3B%0A%20%20return%20value%3B%0A%7D) (lang: meta-language%20structured%20data)))
