.url%29%2C%27utf8%27%29%3B%0A%20const%20branchStart%3D%27const%20originalBranches%3D%27%2CbranchEnd%3D%27%5Cn%7D%3B%5Cnconst%20originalSources%3D%27%3B%0A%20assert.equal%28collectionTests.split%28branchStart%29.length%2C2%29%3Bassert.equal%28collectionTests.split%28branchEnd%29.length%2C2%29%3B%0A%20const%20branches%3DJSON.parse%28collectionTests.slice%28collectionTests.indexOf%28branchStart%29%2BbranchStart.length%2CcollectionTests.indexOf%28branchEnd%29%2B2%29%29%3B%0A%20for%28const%5Btarget%2Cpin%5Dof%20Object.entries%28%7B%0A%20%20JavaScript%3A%277b0bd63e09ce0aa72bb077aa0cdce0b9daaab036e2c0d1e739c59b830b59df5b%27%2CRust%3A%279d7d395b1fac905a4455c472eeb81939b33e4d1781a457744913425498dd22e1%27%2C%0A%20%20Lean%3A%2759d6c5001f117178abc22962f9063fdb4ec22fefe8512452a013cbc3064e4294%27%2CRocq%3A%27c03707727d898497d151101c8ff4e748f6bef2e6ee5b3afbc1ffa8eae58dc267%27%2C%0A%20%7D%29%29assert.equal%28createHash%28%27sha256%27%29.update%28branches%5Btarget%5D%29.digest%28%27hex%27%29%2Cpin%2C%27the%20original%20%27%2Btarget%2B%27%20constructor%20template%20stays%20independently%20frozen%27%29%3B%0A%20const%20collectionPolicy%3DreadProjectData%28new%20URL%28%27..%2F..%2Fjs%2Fsrc%2Ftranslation%2Fdata%2Fcollection-construction-rules.lino%27%2Cimport.meta.url%29%29%3B%0A%20assert.deepEqual%28readProjectData%28new%20URL%28%27..%2F..%2Frust%2Fsrc%2Fdata%2Fcollection-construction-rules.lino%27%2Cimport.meta.url%29%29%2CcollectionPolicy%29%3B%0A%20assert.equal%28collectionPolicy.sourceSha256%2C%27e9e21ed1c12c208190ec62595d2f3f52fd6a1329a82df133832f7add8f683502%27%29%3B%0A%20const%20collectionSource%3DreadFileSync%28new%20URL%28%27..%2F..%2F%27%2BcollectionPolicy.sourcePath%2Cimport.meta.url%29%2C%27utf8%27%29%3B%0A%20assert.equal%28collectionPolicy.source%2CcollectionSource%29%3B%0A%20for%28const%20input%20of%20collectionPolicy.sourceClosure.inputs%29%7B%0A%20%20const%20bytes%3DreadFileSync%28new%20URL%28%27..%2F..%2F%27%2Binput.path%2Cimport.meta.url%29%29%3B%0A%20%20assert.equal%2